    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your dream orchard by shaking trees for a burst of delicious fruits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/9bbc94087b3282783fc4b4db381fd00f.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/9bbc94087b3282783fc4b4db381fd00f.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/9bbc94087b3282783fc4b4db381fd00f.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet: Co!</strong><br>Co is an upbeat and curious adventurer.\u00a0With a friendly smile and a can-do attitude, Co embodies enthusiasm for nurturing each tiny sprout into a flourishing tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/16570a868b3c5c2ded97d8dac5733596.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/16570a868b3c5c2ded97d8dac5733596.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/16570a868b3c5c2ded97d8dac5733596.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-On Tree Shaking</strong> <br>Give each tree a good shake to make fruits tumble to the ground, offering a satisfying, interactive way to harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/0efe67acae1e7e69dcf1b335dfa3ffa4.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/0efe67acae1e7e69dcf1b335dfa3ffa4.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/0efe67acae1e7e69dcf1b335dfa3ffa4.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong>hill Mode<br>Tired from all the shaking of your mouse? Just go into chill mode and suddenly shaking trees is way more easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/ade3de59608c863034dcb211b0ca00c7.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/ade3de59608c863034dcb211b0ca00c7.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/ade3de59608c863034dcb211b0ca00c7.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sapling Buying &amp; Planting</strong> <br>Buy unique saplings, drop them where you want them to grow, and <strong>watch as tiny saplings become fruit-bearing trees</strong>. Expand your orchard any way you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/5d48c855ef9cc91186be4a7ca515685a.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/5d48c855ef9cc91186be4a7ca515685a.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/5d48c855ef9cc91186be4a7ca515685a.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn &amp; Reinvent</strong> <br>Sell your harvested fruit for coins, then pour your profits into faster-growing trees, better shakes, or idle boosters to <strong>supercharge</strong> your orchard\u2019s output.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your dream orchard by shaking trees for a burst of delicious fruits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/9bbc94087b3282783fc4b4db381fd00f.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/9bbc94087b3282783fc4b4db381fd00f.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/9bbc94087b3282783fc4b4db381fd00f.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet: Co!</strong><br>Co is an upbeat and curious adventurer.\u00a0With a friendly smile and a can-do attitude, Co embodies enthusiasm for nurturing each tiny sprout into a flourishing tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/16570a868b3c5c2ded97d8dac5733596.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/16570a868b3c5c2ded97d8dac5733596.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/16570a868b3c5c2ded97d8dac5733596.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-On Tree Shaking</strong> <br>Give each tree a good shake to make fruits tumble to the ground, offering a satisfying, interactive way to harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/0efe67acae1e7e69dcf1b335dfa3ffa4.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/0efe67acae1e7e69dcf1b335dfa3ffa4.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/0efe67acae1e7e69dcf1b335dfa3ffa4.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong>hill Mode<br>Tired from all the shaking of your mouse? Just go into chill mode and suddenly shaking trees is way more easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/ade3de59608c863034dcb211b0ca00c7.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/ade3de59608c863034dcb211b0ca00c7.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/ade3de59608c863034dcb211b0ca00c7.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sapling Buying &amp; Planting</strong> <br>Buy unique saplings, drop them where you want them to grow, and <strong>watch as tiny saplings become fruit-bearing trees</strong>. Expand your orchard any way you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/5d48c855ef9cc91186be4a7ca515685a.poster.avif?t=1753131532\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/5d48c855ef9cc91186be4a7ca515685a.webm?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578070/extras/5d48c855ef9cc91186be4a7ca515685a.mp4?t=1753131532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn &amp; Reinvent</strong> <br>Sell your harvested fruit for coins, then pour your profits into faster-growing trees, better shakes, or idle boosters to <strong>supercharge</strong> your orchard\u2019s output.</p></li></ul>",
